{"seq":1,"slug":"mod-inference","title":"推理实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/practice/mod-inference","wordCount":1488,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理实现\">推理实现</h1><p>训练侧的两块硬骨头——梯度穿过离散选择、非因果 top-k——已经分别被 <a href=\"../training/differentiable-routing\">可微路由</a> 和 <a href=\"../training/router-prediction\">路由预测器</a> 解决了。可把一个训好的 MoD 模型真正塞进推理引擎跑得快，还有一层完全不同的工程账要算：动态路由必须编译成形状固定的核，被跳过的 token 的 KV 缓存要正确处理，一个 batch 里长短不一的序列要在容量上对齐。这一篇讲的就是「怎么让 MoD 在真实推理里既正确又快」，而推理引擎本身的连续批处理、分页注意力等通用机制不在这里展开，属于 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/\">推理系统 (58)</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把动态选择收敛回静态形状\">核心概念：把动态选择收敛回静态形状</h2><p>MoD 推理性能的全部前提，是 <a href=\"../mechanism/capacity-budget\">容量预算</a> 里那个「选几个是写死的」设计。因为每块进块的 token 数是常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌈</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌉</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=\\lceil c\\cdot S\\rceil</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌉</span></span></span></span></span>，推理引擎可以这样跑一个 MoD 块：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>路由器 / 预测器给序列每个 token 打分；</li>\n<li>用一次 gather 把选中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 的隐藏向量收拢成一个紧凑张量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[K, d]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li>让这个固定形状的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[K,d]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 张量走完整的自注意力 + 前馈；</li>\n<li>用一次 scatter 把块输出（乘上门控后）写回原来 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个位置的残差流，其余位置原样保留。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键在于第 3 步的计算核形状恒为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[K,d]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，与输入内容无关，编译器（如 torch.compile、XLA）能把它当稠密核一样优化，不会退化成数据依赖的动态图。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;序列 S 个 token 隐藏向量&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;预测器打分&lt;br/&gt;因果, 逐 token&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[gather 选中的 K 个&lt;br/&gt;紧凑张量 [K, d]&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;静态块核&lt;br/&gt;attention + FFN&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;乘门控 g(r)&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;scatter 写回原位置&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; G[&quot;未选中的 S-K 个&lt;br/&gt;残差原样保留&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; H[&quot;合并残差流 → 下一块&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"序列 S 个 token 隐藏向量\"] --&gt; B[\"预测器打分&lt;br/&gt;因果, 逐 token\"]\n  B --&gt; C[gather 选中的 K 个&lt;br/&gt;紧凑张量 [K, d]\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"静态块核&lt;br/&gt;attention + FFN\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"乘门控 g(r)\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"scatter 写回原位置\"]\n  A --&gt; G[\"未选中的 S-K 个&lt;br/&gt;残差原样保留\"]\n  F --&gt; H[\"合并残差流 → 下一块\"]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"被跳过-token-的-kv-缓存怎么办\">被跳过 token 的 KV 缓存怎么办</h2><p>这是 MoD 推理里最容易出错的地方，也是它和普通稠密推理最不一样的一点。在自注意力里，每个 token 会往 KV 缓存写入自己的 key/value 供后续 token 注意。问题是：一个在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 层被 MoD 跳过的 token，它没进这一层的注意力计算，那它在第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span> 层<strong>有没有 KV 缓存条目</strong>？</p>\n<p>答案必须是「没有」——被跳过的 token 在该层不产生 key/value，因此该层的 KV 缓存里就是缺这一条。于是 MoD 模型每一个 MoD 层的 KV 缓存都是「稀疏」的：只有当层进过块的那 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 才有条目。后续 token 在这一层做注意力时，可注意的历史 key/value 也只有这些进过块的位置。这既是 MoD 省内存的额外红利（KV 缓存在 MoD 层只需存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 份而非 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 份），也是实现上的陷阱：注意力的掩码和位置索引必须严格对齐「这一层实际有哪些 token 在场」，写错就会静默地让某些 token 注意到不存在的缓存位、或漏掉本该可见的历史。KV 缓存的通用管理与分页机制见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/inference-systems/kv-cache-compression\">长上下文：KV 缓存压缩</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>稠密模型</th>\n<th>MoD 层</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每层 KV 缓存条目数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（全部 token）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=cS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（仅进块 token）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>被跳过 token 的 KV</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>注意力可见历史</td>\n<td>全历史</td>\n<td>该层进块过的历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 内存占用</td>\n<td>基线</td>\n<td>MoD 层显著更低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>掩码 / 位置索引</td>\n<td>常规</td>\n<td>须按层实际在场 token 对齐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"逐-token-生成-预测器上线\">逐 token 生成：预测器上线</h2><p>预填充（prefill）阶段整段 prompt 可见，可以直接用非因果 top-k（和训练一致）选出每块的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token，快而准。真正需要 <a href=\"../training/router-prediction\">路由预测器</a> 的是解码阶段：每生成一个新 token，就用预测器逐个判断它在每个 MoD 层进不进块。这里有一个前面埋下的扰动——按阈值独立判断时，实际进块数会围绕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 浮动，不再严格等于容量。工程上两种吸收办法：一是设一个略宽的容量上限，浮动落在上限内就按上限的静态核跑、空位 padding；二是接受轻微的形状变动，靠 torch.compile 的少量分桶（几个固定容量档）覆盖常见浮动范围。前者简单省心但略浪费，后者更省但编译档位要调。</p>\n<h2 id=\"batch-内的容量对齐\">batch 内的容量对齐</h2><p>容量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K=cS</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是按单条序列算的，而真实推理是成批跑的，一个 batch 里各序列长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不同，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_i=cS_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 也就各不相同。这直接破坏了 batch 张量「同一维度对齐」的前提——<a href=\"../mechanism/capacity-budget\">容量预算</a> 结尾点明的正是这层张力。常见解法有三：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>padding 到统一容量</strong>：取 batch 内最大的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，短序列 padding 到它，简单但浪费算力。</li>\n<li><strong>按长度分桶</strong>：把长度相近的序列分到同一桶，桶内容量接近，减少 padding 浪费，是连续批处理里的常规套路。</li>\n<li><strong>变长 / ragged 核</strong>：用支持变长的注意力核（如 FlashAttention 的变长接口）直接吃不等长输入，最省但工程复杂、和 MoD 的 gather/scatter 要小心配合。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>选哪种取决于负载画像和引擎能力；多数落地实现从「分桶 + padding」起步，因为它和现有的连续批处理栈（见 <a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/continuous-batching\">推理系统：连续批处理</a>）最好接。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>MoD 推理的前提是容量固定：gather 选中的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 个 token 成紧凑 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[K,d]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 张量走静态块核，scatter 写回，编译器可当稠密核优化。</li>\n<li>被跳过 token 在该 MoD 层不产生 KV 缓存条目，缓存天然稀疏——既是省内存红利，也是掩码 / 位置索引必须严格对齐「层内在场 token」的陷阱。</li>\n<li>预填充可用非因果 top-k；解码阶段靠因果预测器逐 token 判断，进块数围绕 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 浮动，用容量上限 padding 或少量分桶吸收。</li>\n<li>batch 内各序列 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不同，破坏张量对齐，用 padding / 长度分桶 / 变长核解决，落地多从分桶 + padding 起步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本库：<a href=\"../mechanism/capacity-budget\">容量预算</a> —— 静态形状与 batch 对齐张力的来源。</li>\n<li>本库：<a href=\"../training/router-prediction\">路由预测器</a> —— 解码阶段因果决策的替身。</li>\n<li>本库：<a href=\"mod-in-practice\">落地与边界</a> —— 这些工程成本值不值得付。</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/continuous-batching\">推理系统：连续批处理</a> —— MoD 容量对齐要接入的通用批处理栈。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理实现","id":"推理实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把动态选择收敛回静态形状","id":"核心概念-把动态选择收敛回静态形状"},{"level":2,"text":"被跳过 token 的 KV 缓存怎么办","id":"被跳过-token-的-kv-缓存怎么办"},{"level":2,"text":"逐 token 生成：预测器上线","id":"逐-token-生成-预测器上线"},{"level":2,"text":"batch 内的容量对齐","id":"batch-内的容量对齐"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"训练稳定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/training/training-stability"},"next":{"title":"与 MoE 组合 (MoDE)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/mixture-of-depths/practice/mod-moe-combination"}}